senses.gloss:
पुल, अस्, आ, अम्, extended, wide, vast, great,
extensive; (अस्), m. erection of the hairs of the
body (considered as a proof of exquisite delight);
horripilation; N. of one of the attendants of Śiva;
(आ), f. the soft palate or uvula.

पुलिन्द, आस्, m. pl., N. of a barbarous tribe;
(अस्), m. a man of this tribe, a king of the Pulindas;
a barbarian, savage, Mleccha, mountaineer, one who
uses an uncultivated and unintelligible dialect.

पुलिन्दक, आस्, m. pl., N. of a barbarous tribe;
(अस्), m., N. of a king of the Pulindas, Śavaras, and
Bhillas; of a son of Ārdraka.
